                                                "sense_id": "4a5e29e9-8e17-30ae-b9df-94082163e994",
                                                "text": "Our next step will be to understand how the basic economic law of capitalism works under imperialism, and how monopoly superprofits are extracted from imperialism's \"third world\" periphery."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "12f2ad35-9272-421d-a947-801612674312",
                                                "sense_id": "4a5e29e9-8e17-30ae-b9df-94082163e994",
                                                "text": "Obviously, out of such enormous superprofits (since they are obtained over and above the profits which capitalists squeeze out of the workers of their 'own' country) it is possible to bribe the labour leaders[…]"
                                            }
